        "name": "ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "PHANPY uses its long nose to shower\nitself. When others gather around, they\nthoroughly douse each other with water.\fThese POKéMON can be seen drying their\nsoaking-wet bodies at the edge of\nwater.",
